  "description_text": {
    "ja": "レース中盤始めにスキルで持久力を回復\\nしていて、レース中間付近以降で\\n好位置だと速度がちょっと上がる\\nゴールまですごく遠いと少し上がる",
    "en": "If you used a stamina-recovery skill during the first half of the Middle Leg, then around the half point of the race, if you're in a good position but not leading, your speed will increase; it will increase greatly if there's at least 1000 m remaining at that point",
